title: "SynechismCore"
abstract: >-
  Code, results and technical report for a study of continuous-time latent
  dynamics (a latent neural ODE, SynechismV23) versus Transformer, LSTM and
  Mamba forecasters for long-horizon forecasting of the chaotic Lorenz-63
  system under irregular sampling.
